Subject: [PATCH 1/5] research(4leaf): targeted extract of every 1171/1167
 frame plus action and D4 evidence

New workflow rog-original-targeted-extract.yml (non-main branches only):
SHA1-verifies the archived 2002 client, then
tools/extract-targeted-original-frames.py
- decodes EVERY frame of OBS.pak 1171.obs (D6, 28 declared) and 1167.obs
  (score numerals, 25 declared) with decode_rows(alpha_from_runs=True) and
  commits them to original/OBS/ui/ with manifest.js and report.json;
- compares each against the published bulk PNG and the colour-key
  corrected copy pixel by pixel (differences that are only index-0 pixels
  made opaque are counted separately);
- writes per-frame geometry and a contact sheet for EVERY member of
  OBS/OBS2/OBS3, an origin-aligned animated GIF for every 37-frame member
  (action-table review), and d4-candidates.json, to a 30-day artifact.
Unreadable members are listed, never dropped. No labels are asserted.

tests/test_targeted_original_extract.py: 5 synthetic cases, no original
bytes. Not yet run on the original archive.

